      "title": "忠義沈勁本傳父充與吳儒",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "沈勁，字世堅，吳興武康人也。父充，與王敦構逆，眾敗而逃，為部曲將吳儒所殺。",
